  <h2 id="lanes">Career options after NEET, ordered by headroom</h2>

  <p>
    The order is by scalability, not prestige and not exam difficulty. Routes where skill can be sold directly or grown into a practice come first.
  </p>

  <p>
    MBBS and BDS stay in the list so you can see what they carry, but they are rated Not so scalable because success needs a win at stage after stage. That rating describes growth, not worth.
  </p>

  <div class="lane-grid">
    {laneCards.map((item) => (
