        <li>The family can fund the year without a loan.</li>
        <li>You will run a backup lane and one skill beside the preparation.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--teal">
      <div class="compare-card__label">Moving on may be smarter when</div>
      <ul>
        <li>The gap is far larger than a plan can plausibly close.</li>
        <li>The interest is in health work, not specifically the doctor title.</li>
        <li>A government seat in another lane is already in hand.</li>
      </ul>
